---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---
<section class="section shell research-proof" aria-labelledby="research-proof-title">
  <div class="research-proof__head" data-reveal>
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Built from current research</span><h2 id="research-proof-title">From theorem<br /><span class="serif gradient-text">to implementation.</span></h2></div>
    <div class="research-proof__paper"><strong>A Faster Deterministic Algorithm for<br />Fully Dynamic Maximal Matching</strong><span>Julia Chuzhoy · Sanjeev Khanna · Junkai Song · STOC 2026</span><a class="text-link" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.00797v1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the paper ↗</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="research-proof__map" data-reveal>
    <div class="research-proof__row research-proof__header"><span>Paper area</span><span>Axiom status</span></div>
    <div class="research-proof__row"><span>Subgraph system</span><strong class="is-done">Implemented</strong></div>
    <div class="research-proof__row"><span>Recursive levels</span><strong class="is-done">Implemented and checked</strong></div>
    <div class="research-proof__row"><span>Invariant I3</span><strong class="is-done">Runtime checked</strong></div>
    <div class="research-proof__row"><span>Colouring and full bound</span><strong class="is-open">Validation ongoing · not claimed</strong></div>
  </div>
  <a class="research-proof__link text-link" href={`${base}/research/`}>See the complete implementation boundary →</a>
</section>

<style>
  .research-proof { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .research-proof__head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: end; }
  .research-proof h2 { margin-top: 18px; font-size: clamp(35px, 4.8vw, 60px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .research-proof__paper { display: grid; gap: 13px; padding-left: 24px; border-left: 2px solid var(--violet); color: var(--ink-dim); line-height: 1.5; }
  .research-proof__paper strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: 17px; }
  .research-proof__paper span { font: 12px/1.5 var(--font-mono); color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .research-proof__map { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .research-proof__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 15px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink-dim); }
  .research-proof__row:first-child { border-top: 0; }
  .research-proof__header { color: var(--ink-faint); font: 11px var(--font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .research-proof__row strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .is-done { color: var(--mint); } .is-open { color: var(--violet); }
  .research-proof__link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .research-proof__head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .research-proof__paper { padding: 18px 0 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--violet); } .research-proof__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 5px; } }
</style>
